{
    "title": "Anime Dress Up - Doll Dress Up",
    "description": "Anime Dress Up - Doll Dress Up is a fashionable and wonderful dress-up game with shocking graphic effects that will provide females with an unforgettable dress-up experience! This game is ideal for everyone who enjoys fashion and adventure, thanks to its amazing graphics and simple UI.\r\n\u2728 Feature:\r\n\u2022 Characters: We offer a large selection of famous model characters to choose from (from famous princesses to anime females).\r\n\u2022 Experiment with different dress styles, haircuts, expressions, and skin tones.\r\n\u2022 A wide range of accessories for your character!\r\n\u2022 Customize your dolls with over 1000 pieces, and build your anime character, your avatar.\r\nThen you can compete with other stylists with your doll!\r\n\u2728How to play:\r\nTo play Anime Dress Up - Doll Dress Up, players just choose their favorite clothing items, hairstyles, and accessories from the game's large wardrobe and apply them to their princess figure using the game's touch and drag controls. Once their princess is properly dressed and accessorized, they can save and share their masterpiece on social media with friends and family.\r\n\r\nHow do you mix and match to make your anime girl character stand out? You will demonstrate your skills as a master of a fashion collection in the game!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Anime Dress Up - Doll Dress Up is a fashionable and wonderful dress-up game with shocking graphic effects that will provide females with an unforgettable dress-up experience! This game is ideal for everyone who enjoys fashion and adventure, thanks to its amazing graphics and simple UI.<br>\u2728 Feature:<br>\u2022 Characters: We offer a large selection of famous model characters to choose from (from famous princesses to anime females).<br>\u2022 Experiment with different dress styles, haircuts, expressions, and skin tones.<br>\u2022 A wide range of accessories for your character!<br>\u2022 Customize your dolls with over 1000 pieces, and build your anime character, your avatar.<br>Then you can compete with other stylists with your doll!<br>\u2728How to play:<br>To play Anime Dress Up - Doll Dress Up, players just choose their favorite clothing items, hairstyles, and accessories from the game&#39;s large wardrobe and apply them to their princess figure using the game&#39;s touch and drag controls. Once their princess is properly dressed and accessorized, they can save and share their masterpiece on social media with friends and family.<br><br>How do you mix and match to make your anime girl character stand out? You will demonstrate your skills as a master of a fashion collection in the game!",
